                      For the initial design, let's support:
              
              Video upload :              
                        User should be able to:                        
                              upload a video
                              provide title/description
                              specify visibility
                              receive processing status
                              Video playback
                    
              Users should be able to:              
                        search videos
                        open a video
                        stream/watch it
                        resume playback
                        Video metadata
              
              Store:              
                      title
                      description
                      uploader
                      duration
                      thumbnail
                      upload timestamp
                      visibility
                      processing status
                      Search
              
              Users should be able to search videos using:              
                          "Java tutorial"
                          "system design"
                          "Google interview"

              Later extensions
              
                        We can add:                        
                            likes
                            comments
                            subscriptions
                            notifications
                            recommendations
                            watch history
                            playlists
