9. Video Upload Architecture

                Now let's look at uploading.                
                A common mistake is:

                                        Client
                                           ↓
                                        Application Server
                                           ↓
                                        Database
                We don't want the application server to carry huge video uploads.
                
                Instead:

                             Client
                                │
                                ▼
                        Upload Service
                                │
                                │ generate upload URL
                                ▼
                          Signed URL
                                │
                                ▼
                         Object Storage
                                │
                                ▼
                          Upload Event
                                │
                                ▼
                             Queue
                                │
                                ▼
                       Video Processing



================================================================================================================================================================
10. Why direct upload?
                Suppose a user uploads a 5 GB video.
                
                If the request goes:
                        Client
                         ↓
                        Application Server
                         ↓
                        Object Storage

                the application server becomes a bandwidth bottleneck.
                
                Instead:

                        Client
                           │
                           │ directly uploads
                           ▼
                        Object Storage


                The backend only handles authorization and upload coordination.
                
                Interview statement
                
                                “I'd use a pre-signed upload URL so the client can upload directly to object storage. 
                                This keeps the application tier stateless and prevents large media transfers from consuming application-server resources.”
                
                Excellent L5 reasoning.

================================================================================================================================================================

11. What happens after upload?

                The video is not immediately ready for playback.
                
                We need processing.

                                Object Storage
                                      │
                                      ▼
                                Upload Event
                                      │
                                      ▼
                                Message Queue
                                      │
                                      ▼
                                Video Processing Workers

                Workers perform:
                        
                        validation
                        virus/security scanning
                        transcoding
                        thumbnail generation
                        metadata extraction
                        packaging


================================================================================================================================================================

12. Why asynchronous processing?
                                Suppose a 2 GB video takes several minutes to process.                                
                                We don't want:

                                HTTP request
                                     │
                                     ▼
                                wait 5 minutes
                                     │
                                     ▼
                                response


                        Instead:
                        
                                        Upload
                                           ↓
                                        202 Accepted
                                           ↓
                                        Processing asynchronously


                The user can be notified when processing completes.

        L5 answer
        
        “Video transcoding is CPU/GPU intensive and potentially long-running, 
                so I'd decouple it from the upload request using an event-driven pipeline.”

================================================================================================================================================================
13. Video Transcoding

                Users upload videos in many formats:

                        MOV
                        MP4
                        AVI
                        MKV
                        ...


        Devices also support different codecs and resolutions.
        
        Therefore:

                Original Video
                      │
                      ▼
                Transcoding Pipeline
                      │
                 ┌────┼─────────┐
                 ▼    ▼         ▼
                144p 720p      1080p

We can generate multiple bitrate representations.
================================================================================================================================================================
14. Why multiple resolutions?

                        Suppose a user has poor network connectivity.                        
                        If we only have:                        
                                                1080p
                        
                        the video may constantly buffer.
Instead:

1080p
720p
480p
360p
144p

The player can dynamically switch.




================================================================================================================================================================
15. Adaptive Bitrate Streaming

                This is an important YouTube concept.
                
                Instead of downloading one huge video file:
                
                                video.mp4
                
                we divide it into small segments.






